===Spain vs Belgium===
In the 35th minute, [[Jan Ceulemans]] put Belgium into the lead with a diving header from six yards out to the right corner after a cross from the left. [[Juan Antonio Señor]] made it 1–1 in the 85th minute with a swerving shot from outside the penalty area. The match went to extra-time and then to [[List of FIFA World Cup penalty shoot-outs|penalties]]. The only miss during the shoot-out was from [[Eloy Olaya]] when [[Jean-Marie Pfaff]] saved down low to his right as Belgium won 5–4.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://goalscorner.com/blogs/guides/spain-vs-belgium-1986-world-cup-quarterfinal/|title=Spain vs Belgium 1986 World Cup Quarterfinal: The Night Puebla Broke Spanish Hearts|date=7 July 2026|work=Goalscorner.com|accessdate=8 July 2026}}</ref>

